Concept ACK

I think we can implement the broader cache as attempted here #33421, mempool estimator dependency on `ChainStateManager` will be gone, and the ipc `createnewblock`, `waitnext` and `getblocktemplate` RPC can use it too. That way we have shared code for all three?

This has a bit of an advantage when the 7 sec for the mempool fee rate estimator elapses and no mempool change, we wont rebuilt; same for the waitnext too. We can later extend to use actual top block inflow to decide not just mempool transaction list number change, that may not affect the top block.

<details>
<summary>see POC</summary>

