@ismaelsadeeq Thanks for the Concept ACK and the POC. I’d prefer to keep this PR focused on moving the existing getblocktemplate cache while preserving its behavior.

The POC introduces multiple entries keyed by build options, eviction, another mutex, configurable freshness and forced rebuilds, plus changes to IPC and fee estimation. Those bring separate correctness and performance questions, so I think the broader cache would be a better fit for a follow-up.

This refactor gives that work a place to build on.
